ur protagonist in their investigations of mysterious cases across Tokyo. She lost her younger brother during a past case involving a strange series of high school students’ deaths."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137706"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2aee2e6d81e1abd02df1a8eb8c2ed27c9331d32ad9a396deaaeb80016e89e55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e668711dafaa316700b3b6e46bff266676c37986b2660217b5d48c3f1b368b1.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"千本木 彩花","creatorId":"vndb:s12945","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12945","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12945","name":"千本木 彩花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97140","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137707","characterName":"杵島・L・ユイカ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137707"},"originalCharacterName":"杵島・L・ユイカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Formerly a member of the Public Security Bureau of the Metropolitan Police Department, she was once engaged with anti-terrorist efforts in Japan protecting confidential government information. Amidst her investigative activities, she caught word of the Iwai Detective Agency and met the protagonist. However, after having discovered the corruption within the police force and Public Safety Department, she decided to resign from her position. Currently, she belongs to the Public Security Intelligence Agencey of the Ministry of Justice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137707"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03bde327a88b31b0ff71cd068a9a6ab9afe92dd42d14ead287877c30448f0cf8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c6ca412a73bd2a9cdbe1a148c743ae92ee9a9380b46d3bf0bea3b6e542b24f0.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"沢城 みゆき","creatorId":"vndb:s43","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s43","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s43","name":"沢城 みゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97135","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137708","characterName":"岩井 賢二","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137708"},"originalCharacterName":"岩井 賢二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Former head investigator of the Iwai Detective Agency. During a case, he met the protagonist and Tomona. He was working to uncover a behind the scenes conspiracy involving the government and police force. Amidst this investigation, he was wrongly framed as a terrorist and convicted. He is currently serving time in prison."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137708"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/451a1260af25701bb3a6518546e53af087d1fcd2628f40064e71c43795fd0b8c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a073cd16d3690784850db95cf4475e9eb03a7e0065d4c01ddc0cd0326602cc1b.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"てらそま まさき","creatorId":"vndb:s753","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s753","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s753","name":"てらそま まさき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97138","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137709","characterName":"栢原 隆一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137709"},"originalCharacterName":"栢原 隆一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A talented engineer who works with corporate infrastructure and security. His hobbies include browsing the dark web and visiting concept cafes. He met the protagonist and Tomona through an investigation of a cult that was active on the internet. He is highly skilled in hacking, using his skills to constantly track the protagonist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137709"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c1a1f70d43fe1432e478f0ed450124b9138361b7b834bdc2cd27d5f06b07d8ac.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9116823e448c30e16c574cdd8412bb7053ea4791697bc4d8d0502dd12b5a67f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森田 成一","creatorId":"vndb:s176","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s176","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s176","name":"森田 成一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97136","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137710","characterName":"戸塚 祐介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137710"},"originalCharacterName":"戸塚 祐介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A highly skilled neurosurgeon working and residing in Tokyo. His father was an expert in genome analysis whose devotion to his work forced him to withdraw from his university work and take his own life. His father had always said to “conduct research that can shine light on the lives of many,” and so he carries on this aspiration through providing medical assistance in the protagonist’s case."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137710"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07dee374fe5ab123e1546a7543a193026f6918ff6ae4d238577b8810b9341a1e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04b99d74825f7ebb9db43c137a18fe0be0f64ad3634639d2e904a82107f07cc8.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"速水 奨","creatorId":"vndb:s751","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s751","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s751","name":"速水 奨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97137","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137711","characterName":"嬉野 めぐり","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137711"},"originalCharacterName":"嬉野 めぐり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A shrine maiden at the ancient Tanogo Shrine which stands unnoticed in Tokyo. She has an accute sensitivity to the energy flow of people and nature more so than any regular person, she can even have premonitions in her dreams. When she was a high school student, she met the protagonist while they were visiting the shrine and foresaw their strange future. She uses her knowledge in the supernatural to explain phenomenan to the protagonist and Tomona."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137711"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d97a10c5b09b4b8f2be7dd1c255f563b16462351dbe3ac92fbd094953577e5a7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddea9c3096a48107e6b6fa5601e46bacd116fde80a106e3536a3fe6091918117.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平野 綾","creatorId":"vndb:s1500","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1500","name":"平野 綾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:97139","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137712","characterName":"本來 勇次郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137712"},"originalCharacterName":"本來 勇次郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A detective at the Shinjuku Police Station. Formerly a police officer, he is now in charge of investigating murders and violent crimes. Due to his aggressiveness in investigations and general poor conduct, the chief of the police department forces him to be an advisor to a new detective. Even though he was resistant at first, the two seem to make a suprisingly good team."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137712"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37d5458208966ae1a514b49c6d1edac89a23f4b97b10836fdc28b450ba290ad5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/12/12d93d3867ca8c88c5fc7445bd8fd51a9f2d8176ae643cbbf544f2e47755c73f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c137713","characterName":"清原 恒介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c137713"},"originalCharacterName":"清原 恒介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young detective at the Shinjuku Police Station. Though he doesn’t particularly enjoy spending time with his superior, Motora, he has a certain respect for him and hopes he can become a useful member of the force. He’s a bit disorganized and isn’t the most passionate, but he finds a purpose in the satisfaction of bringing justice to criminals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Official Website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137713"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e479b2c4630d39a1e36968c4de176cb81bb6499d9fdef30234c18d820dd05b5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c8ae50d91da12fd843c6d6f16ca6dd5c12edfe74e75ac2a0f1f1f8623d2239f8.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c164826","characterName":"大槻 泰三","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c164826"},"originalCharacterName":"大槻 泰三","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"608"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal